    "q-85667": {
      "dom_id": "step-q85667",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "What is the sum of the series $1-\\frac{e}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2}}{16}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}{e}^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯\\,?$",
      "worked_solution": "The first thing we notice is that we can rewrite the terms of the series as powers of $\\frac{e}{4}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-\\frac{e}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2}}{16}-⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}{e}^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯ & =1-\\frac{e}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+⋯+(-1)^{n}\\frac{{e}^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯ \\\\  & =1-\\frac{e}{4}+{(\\frac{e}{4})}^{2}+⋯+(-1)^{n}{(\\frac{e}{4})}^{n}+⋯\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we recognize that the series looks similar to the Maclaurin expansion for $f(x)=\\frac{1}{1+x}.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{1+x} & =1-x+{x}^{2}-{x}^{3}+⋯+(-1)^{n}{x}^{n}+⋯\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{e}{4}$ into our Maclaurin expansion gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{(1+\\frac{e}{4})} & =1-\\frac{e}{4}+{(\\frac{e}{4})}^{2}-{(\\frac{e}{4})}^{3}+⋯+(-1)^{n}{(\\frac{e}{4})}^{n}+⋯ \\\\ \\frac{4}{4+e} & =1-\\frac{e}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{e}^{3}}{64}+⋯+\\frac{(-1)^{n}{e}^{n}}{{4}^{n}}+⋯\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sum of the series is $\\frac{4}{4+e}.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-85667-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{4+e}{4}",
              "html": " <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"28\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> "
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-85667-b",
