>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mstyle></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>64</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the sum of the series is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
